
> asscrack@0.6.0 test
> node --test

✔ main.js forwards the history event (11.199238ms)
✔ preload.cjs exposes onHistory (1.328587ms)
✔ renderer.js listens for history (1.712047ms)
✔ main.js writes a log file with the window console (2.10847ms)
✔ main.js forwards the topology event (1.167584ms)
✔ preload.cjs exposes onTopology and getTopology (0.921963ms)
✔ main.js logs the direction, the cancel side and the file actions (1.557942ms)
✔ preload.cjs passes a peer ID in cancelFile (1.009464ms)
✔ preload.cjs exposes revealFile by key and no path API for the reveal (1.279228ms)
✔ main.js records the receive path of file-done by offerId|peerId and checks that the file exists (2.008713ms)
✔ renderer.js has one Escape dispatcher in the sequence menu, layout, invite panel, map (3.071546ms)
✔ menu.js handles no Escape itself (1.639119ms)
✔ the row buttons and the menus call the same action functions (2.418968ms)
✔ nodemap.js highlights a node by peer ID with a data attribute (2.115395ms)
✔ menu.js, renderer.js and nodemap.js set no inline style (2.637824ms)
✔ menu.js loads with no DOM and gives menuCore only (1.861221ms)
✔ menuCore.actionsFor gives the actions of each target (1.761049ms)
✔ menuCore.allowed stops a stale action after the transfer completed (1.298513ms)
✔ menuCore keys and position (2.565058ms)
✔ the Escape dispatcher closes the find bar and then the quote chip, between layout and the invite panel (1.105134ms)
✔ find.js and quote.js handle no Escape and set no inline style (1.783924ms)
✔ the Quote button and the menu action Quote run the same row action (1.524767ms)
✔ index.html loads find.js and quote.js before renderer.js, and has the find bar and the quote chip (1.300396ms)
✔ menuCore gives Quote for a quotable message line (2.190835ms)
✔ one duplex stream carries chat both ways and cleans up on disconnect (1243.706213ms)
